"免費試用僅限符合資格的 Apple 帳號，且須先確認訂閱。試用結束後，按所選月繳或年繳方案自動續訂並收費。請於試用或當期結束至少 24 小時前取消，以免續訂。實際價格、試用資格與扣款日期以 App Store 確認畫面為準。" = "Free trials require an eligible Apple Account and subscription confirmation. After the trial, your selected monthly or annual plan renews automatically for a fee. Cancel at least 24 hours before the trial or current period ends to avoid renewal. The App Store confirmation determines the price, eligibility and billing date.";
