"帳本與儲存" = "Accounts and storage";
"收支、庫存、資產、備忘與攤商資料儲存在此裝置的 App 資料空間。本版本沒有開發者帳號系統或自動雲端同步，也不將帳本金額傳送至開發者伺服器。移除 App 或遺失裝置可能造成資料遺失，請定期匯出備份。" = "Accounts, inventory, assets, notes and stall data are stored in the app on this device. This version has no developer account system or automatic cloud sync and does not send account amounts to developer servers. Uninstalling the app or losing the device may cause data loss. Export backups regularly.";
"Apple 訂閱" = "Apple subscriptions";
"訂閱、付款、試用資格與退款由 Apple 處理。App 使用 StoreKit 取得商品、購買驗證與訂閱權益狀態。開發者不會取得你的完整付款卡號。Apple 可能依其隱私權政策處理帳號與付款資料。" = "Apple handles subscriptions, payments, trial eligibility and refunds. The app uses StoreKit for products, purchase verification and entitlement status. The developer does not receive your full payment card number. Apple may process account and payment data under its privacy policy.";
"備份與分享" = "Backups and sharing";
"只有在你主動匯出或分享時，帳本才會交給你選擇的檔案位置或服務。備份可能含營業與財務資訊，請妥善保管。訂閱到期仍可匯出既有資料。" = "Accounts are sent to your selected location or service only when you export or share them. Backups may contain business and financial data; keep them safe. Existing data can be exported after expiry.";
"資料控制" = "Data control";
"你可以在各帳本功能編輯或刪除紀錄，並自行保管或刪除已匯出的備份。本版本不提供廣告追蹤，也未整合第三方廣告或分析 SDK。支援與政策問題請使用 App Store 產品頁的 App 支援連結聯絡。" = "You can edit or delete entries and keep or delete exported backups. This version has no ad tracking or third-party advertising or analytics SDKs. For support or policy questions, use the App Support link on the App Store product page.";
